    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for field-level metadata encryption. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations MUST be thread-safe and stateless with respect to the <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_i_metadata_encryption_provider_1a804f125f11ac848688e67620ac412ffb" kindref="member">encrypt()</ref> / <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_i_metadata_encryption_provider_1a4183cc9936717b32603d31b4839d735f" kindref="member">decrypt()</ref> operations (i.e. concurrent calls with different field names must not interfere with each other). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
